The crate contains the right medicine, just much less of it. The clinic can cover immediate care, but its margin is thinner. A transfer at an intermediate cay may explain the weight change; no theft is established until the original loading and handover counts are compared.','The medicine is real but the quantity is wrong. Which transfer record can close the gap?','colony_wide',v_location,v_primary,0.95,1,60,'standard',v_facts,true,array['worldwide','major-incident']::text[],'{"contentDigest":"1e606a37a48cd52118ebe58028fac5e62e2f87a6eee48ad18f0bb9c88526371b","pulseTier":"major"}'::jsonb) on conflict (world_id,slug) do update set content_version = excluded.content_version,title = excluded.title,feed_summary = excluded.feed_summary,detail_body = excluded.detail_body,group_message = excluded.group_message,event_type = excluded.event_type,location_id = excluded.location_id,primary_character_template_id = excluded.primary_character_template_id,significance = excluded.significance,selection_weight = excluded.selection_weight,cooldown_days = excluded.cooldown_days,content_rating = excluded.content_rating,facts = excluded.facts,active = true,tags = excluded.tags,metadata = excluded.metadata,updated_at = now() returning id into v_template;
